1
00:00:28,210 --> 00:00:32,220
NARRATOR : In the 17th century , Satan was abroad on the Earth

2
00:00:32,340 --> 00:00:35,300
and great was the wrath against those monstrous beings ,

3
00:00:35,430 --> 00:00:37,260
thirsty for human blood ,

4
00:00:37,390 --> 00:00:41,100
to whom tradition has given the name of " vampires " .

5
00:00:42,640 --> 00:00:45,600
No appeal for pity or mercy availed .

6
00:00:45,730 --> 00:00:48,820
Brothers did not hesitate to accuse brothers

7
00:00:48,940 --> 00:00:51,190
and fathers accused sons

8
00:00:51,320 --> 00:00:55,200
in the frantic attempt to purify the Earth of that horrible race

9
00:00:55,320 --> 00:00:57,030
of blood-devouring assassins .

10
00:00:59,200 --> 00:01:01,200
But before putting them to death ,

11
00:01:01,330 --> 00:01:04,620
human justice anticipated divine judgment

12
00:01:04,750 --> 00:01:07,880
by burning into the flesh of those damned ones

13
00:01:08,000 --> 00:01:10,130
the brand of Satan .

14
00:01:24,140 --> 00:01:28,230
Asa , daughter of the House of Vajda ,

15
00:01:28,360 --> 00:01:32,690
this High Court of the Inquisition of Moldavia

16
00:01:32,820 --> 00:01:34,780
has declared you guilty .

17
00:01:35,820 --> 00:01:39,620
I , the second-born son of Prince Vajda ,

18
00:01:39,740 --> 00:01:43,500
as Grand Inquisitor , do condemn you .

19
00:01:44,620 --> 00:01:48,080
And as your brother , I repudiate you .

20
00:01:49,130 --> 00:01:54,170
Too many evil deeds have you done to satisfy your monstrous love

21
00:01:54,300 --> 00:01:58,140
for that serf of the Devil , lgor Javutich .

22
00:02:00,220 --> 00:02:05,980
May God have pity on your soul in this , your final hour .

23
00:02:07,980 --> 00:02:12,150
Cover her face with the mask of Satan .

24
00:02:12,270 --> 00:02:14,320
Nail it down !

25
00:02:15,360 --> 00:02:19,030
May the cleansing flames reduce her foul body to ashes

26
00:02:20,780 --> 00:02:25,620
so that the wind will obliterate all trace of her existence .

27
00:02:45,810 --> 00:02:47,980
No ... no !

28
00:02:48,850 --> 00:02:50,060
No !

29
00:02:51,020 --> 00:02:52,940
Griabby !

30
00:02:53,070 --> 00:02:55,400
It is I who repudiate you ,

31
00:02:55,530 --> 00:02:59,530
and in the name of Satan I place a curse upon you .

32
00:02:59,660 --> 00:03:01,120
Go ahead ,

33
00:03:01,240 --> 00:03:02,870
tie me down to the stake ,

34
00:03:02,990 --> 00:03:06,500
but you will never escape my hunger , nor that of Satan !

35
00:03:08,080 --> 00:03:11,920
The unchained elements of the powers of darkness are lying in ambush .

36
00:03:12,040 --> 00:03:14,170
Beware , Griabby !

37
00:03:15,380 --> 00:03:18,670
My revenge will strike down you and your accursed house ,

38
00:03:18,800 --> 00:03:21,800
and in the blood of your sons and the sons of their sons

39
00:03:21,930 --> 00:03:24,390
I will continue to live , immortal !

40
00:03:25,890 --> 00:03:29,850
They will restore to me the life that you now rob from me .

41
00:03:32,310 --> 00:03:38,240
I shall return to torment and destroy throughout the night of time .

42
00:03:55,600 --> 00:04:01,700
.

43
00:05:33,890 --> 00:05:36,440
NARRATOR : As if by the Demon 's command ,

44
00:05:36,560 --> 00:05:41,780
the sudden fury of the elements extinguishes the purifying flames .

45
00:05:43,530 --> 00:05:47,450
The terrorised people run in flight from that cursed place . '

46
00:05:50,490 --> 00:05:53,870
And for all that long night , the church bells toll

47
00:05:54,000 --> 00:05:56,500
to keep away the spirits of evil .

48
00:05:59,080 --> 00:06:00,590
When the wrath is spent ,

49
00:06:00,710 --> 00:06:03,920
the body of Javutich is covered with unconsecrated earth

50
00:06:04,050 --> 00:06:07,130
in the burying place reserved for murderers .

51
00:06:10,430 --> 00:06:15,390
And the body of Asa , the witch , is placed in the tomb of her ancestors .

52
00:06:26,200 --> 00:06:31,550
.

53
00:06:31,700 --> 00:06:33,790
Coachman ! Coachman !

54
00:06:33,910 --> 00:06:36,500
How much further to the crossroads at Mirgorod ?

55
00:06:37,460 --> 00:06:39,540
Six or seven versts , my lord .

56
00:06:39,670 --> 00:06:41,340
Did you hear that , sir ?

57
00:06:41,460 --> 00:06:44,510
If we stop at Mirgorod , we 'll never reach Moscow by evening .

58
00:06:44,630 --> 00:06:47,590
It doesn 't matter . We can spend the night at the inn at Mirgorod .

59
00:06:47,720 --> 00:06:50,340
Good smoked salmon and excellent vodka !

60
00:06:50,470 --> 00:06:53,390
We 'll still be in time for the congress tomorrow .

61
00:06:54,430 --> 00:06:56,520
But we 'll miss the opening address .

62
00:06:57,270 --> 00:07:01,900
Too bad . Dr Blistanov of St Petersburg will be there , and Dr Steiner of Vienna .

63
00:07:02,020 --> 00:07:04,190
How long have you had your degree ?

64
00:07:04,320 --> 00:07:07,190
Three years , Professor . I 've been with you for two .

65
00:07:07,320 --> 00:07:10,030
When you 've been in the profession as long as I have ,

66
00:07:10,160 --> 00:07:14,200
you learn to take all the speeches at these conferences with a grain of salt .

67
00:07:16,910 --> 00:07:18,710
Coachman ! Stop !

68
00:07:19,420 --> 00:07:20,920
Ho !

69
00:07:21,040 --> 00:07:22,920
Take the forest road , it 's shorter .

70
00:07:23,630 --> 00:07:26,000
It 's full of holes . No one uses it .

71
00:07:26,000 --> 00:07:27,970
I understand . You 're afraid of the witch !

72
00:07:28,090 --> 00:07:30,130
It 's not so easy to frighten me ,

73
00:07:30,260 --> 00:07:32,470
I fought through the war against Napoleon ,

74
00:07:32,590 --> 00:07:34,560
but to tell you the truth ,

75
00:07:34,680 --> 00:07:38,230
I 'd rather find myself face to face with a cursed Frenchman than ...

76
00:07:38,350 --> 00:07:40,230
than meet up with a ghost .

77
00:07:40,350 --> 00:07:43,650
This will help you to forget all about ghosts . Here you are !

78
00:07:43,770 --> 00:07:45,730
Come on , now , let 's get going !

79
00:07:50,240 --> 00:07:51,570
Ho !

80
00:07:53,030 --> 00:07:54,700
Ho !

81
00:08:15,050 --> 00:08:16,970
What 's that wailing ?

82
00:08:17,100 --> 00:08:19,270
It 's nothing , just the wind in the trees .

83
00:08:21,390 --> 00:08:23,980
- What 's happened ? - The branches of the tree , sir .

84
00:08:24,100 --> 00:08:26,270
That branch reached out and tried to choke me .

85
00:08:26,400 --> 00:08:30,280
Try not to choke yourself with that vodka . Now , get a move on !

86
00:08:33,240 --> 00:08:35,070
Ho ! Ho !

87
00:08:48,130 --> 00:08:49,920
Why is he in such a hurry ?

88
00:08:50,050 --> 00:08:52,260
Well , between my tip and his fear ...

89
00:08:52,380 --> 00:08:53,880
Oh !

90
00:08:54,970 --> 00:08:57,300
Oh , what a mess ! Dear heaven !

91
00:08:57,430 --> 00:08:59,930
Dear heaven , of all places for this to happen .

92
00:09:00,060 --> 00:09:01,520
- Oh ! - Is it serious ?

93
00:09:01,640 --> 00:09:04,520
No , no . Fortunately it just slipped out of the socket .

94
00:09:04,650 --> 00:09:06,190
I 'll have it back in no time .

95
00:09:06,310 --> 00:09:08,320
- Just a minute . - Good .

96
00:09:08,440 --> 00:09:10,730
It certainly isn 't very cheerful here .

97
00:09:10,860 --> 00:09:12,740
That weird sound .

98
00:09:14,360 --> 00:09:16,950
It 's coming from there . Let 's see what it is .

99
00:10:00,240 --> 00:10:01,740
There ! You see ?

100
00:10:01,870 --> 00:10:05,620
It 's just the wind in the pipes of this broken-down organ .

101
00:10:06,500 --> 00:10:07,710
Agh !

102
00:10:07,830 --> 00:10:10,090
What 's happening , my lords ?

103
00:10:10,210 --> 00:10:12,750
It 's nothing . Continue with your work .

104
00:11:25,410 --> 00:11:29,710
More than a thousand years of conflicts , hates and loves

105
00:11:29,830 --> 00:11:32,790
all reduced to dust in these tombs .

106
00:11:32,920 --> 00:11:35,710
Nothing remains of the ancient princes of Vajda

107
00:11:35,840 --> 00:11:38,970
but the dead shadows of their former glory .

108
00:11:39,090 --> 00:11:43,220
The history of ancient Moldavia is carved in these stones .

109
00:12:01,110 --> 00:12:02,950
Andre , come here .

110
00:12:07,990 --> 00:12:09,830
This is the witch of the old legend .

111
00:12:09,960 --> 00:12:11,290
See this bronze mask ?

112
00:12:11,420 --> 00:12:14,250
One was always placed over the face of a condemned witch

113
00:12:14,380 --> 00:12:17,920
so she would wear for all eternity her true face , the face of Satan .

114
00:12:18,050 --> 00:12:19,630
Why is there a window ?

115
00:12:20,470 --> 00:12:22,340
They feared the witch might rise again

116
00:12:22,470 --> 00:12:25,510
and maintained that a cross visible to her through the glass

117
00:12:25,640 --> 00:12:27,260
would keep her nailed down forever .

118
00:12:27,390 --> 00:12:29,430
- Incredible ! - My lords !

119
00:12:30,430 --> 00:12:32,520
My lords , where are you ?

120
00:12:32,640 --> 00:12:35,060
Someone had better come and help me with this wheel .

121
00:12:35,190 --> 00:12:38,610
Please don 't leave me all alone in this infernal place !

122
00:12:41,070 --> 00:12:42,530
He 's frightened to death .

123
00:12:42,650 --> 00:12:45,160
Go and help him . I want to have another look around .

124
00:12:45,280 --> 00:12:47,200
Frankly , I prefer it outside .

125
00:12:47,330 --> 00:12:50,540
Not only is there no air in here , but it 's also a little gloomy .

126
00:13:36,790 --> 00:13:38,880
Professor ?

127
00:13:39,000 --> 00:13:41,170
Professor Kruvajan , what happened ?

128
00:13:41,300 --> 00:13:43,170
- Why did you fire ? - Look here .

129
00:13:43,300 --> 00:13:45,840
That monster attacked me for some reason .

130
00:13:45,970 --> 00:13:47,800
That 's very strange .

131
00:13:48,470 --> 00:13:51,060
Usually bats shy away from human beings .

132
00:13:52,470 --> 00:13:55,770
Let 's get out of here , Professor . We 'll be better off outside .

133
00:13:55,890 --> 00:13:59,020
Otherwise the coachman will be convinced that he 's right .

134
00:13:59,150 --> 00:14:00,730
Wait .

135
00:14:17,420 --> 00:14:19,420
What are you doing ?

136
00:14:22,880 --> 00:14:25,470
Still intact after two centuries .

137
00:14:26,720 --> 00:14:28,550
Oh , you 've cut yourself .

138
00:14:29,340 --> 00:14:31,390
You 're right , I hadn 't noticed it .

139
00:14:31,970 --> 00:14:33,850
It must have been a splinter of glass .

140
00:14:33,970 --> 00:14:36,140
Just a drop or two of blood , that 's all .

141
00:14:37,270 --> 00:14:40,270
Those empty eyes seem to be looking at us .

142
00:14:47,030 --> 00:14:49,280
All right , we 'll go .

143
00:15:37,700 --> 00:15:39,290
Who are you ?

144
00:15:39,410 --> 00:15:40,830
What do you want ?

145
00:15:42,000 --> 00:15:46,250
I am Professor Choma Kruvajan and this is my assistant .

146
00:15:47,550 --> 00:15:49,670
Andre Gorobec .

147
00:15:50,430 --> 00:15:53,510
I was walking in the park when I heard a shot .

148
00:15:53,640 --> 00:15:54,800
What happened ?

149
00:15:55,430 --> 00:15:58,350
I killed a large bat down in the crypt .

150
00:15:58,480 --> 00:16:01,940
You must excuse us for taking the liberty of entering the chapel ,

151
00:16:02,060 --> 00:16:04,110
but we thought it was an abandoned ruin .

152
00:16:04,860 --> 00:16:06,940
We wanted to satisfy our curiosity .

153
00:16:08,190 --> 00:16:11,530
It 's all so strange , so mysterious here .

154
00:16:12,660 --> 00:16:15,240
Everything is going to ruin .

155
00:16:15,370 --> 00:16:20,660
My father , Prince Vajda , refuses to repair even this old chapel .

156
00:16:21,710 --> 00:16:24,080
This place , in his eyes , is a curse .

157
00:16:24,210 --> 00:16:27,420
My lords , the wheel is repaired . We can go now .

158
00:16:27,550 --> 00:16:28,760
All right , we 're coming .

159
00:16:28,880 --> 00:16:31,380
Please excuse us , Princess , but we must go .

160
00:16:31,510 --> 00:16:34,640
We still have five versts to go to Mirgorod .

161
00:16:34,760 --> 00:16:37,140
We are spending the night there .

162
00:16:37,260 --> 00:16:40,230
If you don 't mind , I won 't say goodbye to you .

163
00:16:40,350 --> 00:16:41,810
Perhaps we will meet again .

164
00:16:42,600 --> 00:16:44,480
Yes ...

165
00:16:44,600 --> 00:16:48,570
I trust you will spend a good night at ... Mirgorod .

166
00:17:38,070 --> 00:17:39,950
Well , spellbound ?

167
00:17:41,410 --> 00:17:43,370
What sadness in her eyes .

168
00:17:46,330 --> 00:17:48,040
But look ...

169
00:17:52,510 --> 00:17:54,800
Ah , a souvenir of the witch .

170
00:20:01,800 --> 00:20:04,100
Like a voice breaking off .

171
00:20:09,100 --> 00:20:10,390
- What 's that ? - Wolves !

172
00:20:10,520 --> 00:20:15,400
That 's why I couldn 't find any tracks of wild deer today in the forest .

173
00:20:16,230 --> 00:20:18,940
No , it seems to be something else out there .

174
00:20:21,240 --> 00:20:23,490
Those are not wolves .

175
00:20:29,000 --> 00:20:31,080
The griffin moved .

176
00:20:31,920 --> 00:20:33,420
Constantine ! Katia !

177
00:20:33,540 --> 00:20:35,080
- What is it ? - Father !

178
00:20:35,210 --> 00:20:36,920
- It wasn 't painted like that . - What ?

179
00:20:37,050 --> 00:20:39,800
It was alive before . Now it 's dead .

180
00:20:39,920 --> 00:20:41,720
- What are you saying ? - I 'm certain .

181
00:20:41,840 --> 00:20:44,640
Father 's right , it wasn 't in that position before .

182
00:20:44,760 --> 00:20:48,470
Katia , that portrait has always had a strange effect on you . I wonder why .

183
00:20:49,470 --> 00:20:51,890
It 's like a flame that can 't escape .

184
00:20:52,020 --> 00:20:53,690
There 's something alive about it ,

185
00:20:53,810 --> 00:20:56,440
something different about the eyes , the hands ,

186
00:20:56,560 --> 00:20:59,110
as if it were hiding something .

187
00:20:59,230 --> 00:21:01,190
Sometimes I 'm afraid to go near it .

188
00:21:01,320 --> 00:21:02,990
Katia !

189
00:21:04,280 --> 00:21:06,910
Maybe Constantine is right .

190
00:21:07,030 --> 00:21:09,240
I must have been dreaming .

191
00:21:12,710 --> 00:21:14,920
We 'll say no more about it .

192
00:21:19,170 --> 00:21:21,260
How cold it is !

193
00:21:22,800 --> 00:21:26,840
A chill seems to come out of the fireplace tonight that penetrates into my bones .

194
00:21:26,970 --> 00:21:30,970
Why don 't you get some sleep , Father ? Your eyes are tired .

195
00:21:31,100 --> 00:21:33,020
No , my eyes aren 't tired .

196
00:21:33,980 --> 00:21:35,650
My spirit is .

197
00:21:36,690 --> 00:21:38,770
You two go to bed now . I want to be alone .

198
00:21:38,900 --> 00:21:40,530
Good night .

199
00:21:41,860 --> 00:21:43,490
Good night .

200
00:22:23,230 --> 00:22:25,780
- Good night , my lord . - No , wait , Ivan .

201
00:22:27,110 --> 00:22:29,370
You 've served in this house for many years .

202
00:22:29,490 --> 00:22:31,490
I was born here , sir .

203
00:22:31,620 --> 00:22:33,910
Today 's the feast of St George .

204
00:22:35,250 --> 00:22:39,540
You must know the legend of the curse that was placed on this castle .

205
00:22:39,670 --> 00:22:43,670
Two centuries ago today , two people were executed for practising witchcraft .

206
00:22:44,260 --> 00:22:47,010
Princess Asa and her accomplice , Prince Javutich .

207
00:22:47,130 --> 00:22:50,140
And to their faces was nailed the mask of Satan .

208
00:22:50,260 --> 00:22:52,890
A hundred years later , again on St George 's Day ,

209
00:22:53,010 --> 00:22:55,730
an earthquake destroyed only the ancient chapel ,

210
00:22:55,850 --> 00:22:58,020
and the witch 's tomb was found split open ,

211
00:22:58,140 --> 00:23:00,900
as if Asa had tried to break out to accomplish her revenge .

212
00:23:01,020 --> 00:23:06,360
In fact , that same night Princess Macha died mysteriously .

213
00:23:08,360 --> 00:23:12,370
Macha was beautiful , the very image of Asa .

214
00:23:16,540 --> 00:23:18,750
She was just 21 that day .

215
00:23:20,500 --> 00:23:22,170
Like Katia .

216
00:23:22,880 --> 00:23:25,300
And Katia is her living image .

217
00:23:26,670 --> 00:23:31,140
It 's as if the witch tormented her victims with her own beauty before killing them .

218
00:23:31,260 --> 00:23:35,560
And it 's this resemblance , this repeating of Asa 's vengeance that terrorises me .

219
00:23:35,680 --> 00:23:37,180
I 'm afraid , Ivan .

220
00:23:37,310 --> 00:23:39,270
You mustn 't be afraid , my lord .

221
00:23:39,390 --> 00:23:41,480
The cross will protect you .

222
00:23:41,600 --> 00:23:43,060
Even if what you said is true ,

223
00:23:43,190 --> 00:23:46,320
these monsters are terrified by the sacred symbol of Christ .

224
00:23:46,440 --> 00:23:48,280
Always have it near you and you 'll be safe .

225
00:23:48,400 --> 00:23:50,910
Yes , you 're right , Ivan .

226
00:23:51,030 --> 00:23:55,620
It 's the atmosphere surrounding this cursed day that has upset me so .

227
00:23:55,740 --> 00:23:58,580
Drink your toddy , sir , before it gets cold .

228
00:24:15,890 --> 00:24:18,850
It 's death ! I 've just seen death !

229
00:24:19,810 --> 00:24:23,060
It 's a warning , Ivan . I won 't be afraid .

230
00:24:23,190 --> 00:24:26,650
They won 't win . They cannot win against the symbol of Christ .

231
00:25:33,340 --> 00:25:35,680
- Everything all right , sir ? - Yes , thank you .

232
00:25:35,800 --> 00:25:38,260
You were right , Professor , this vodka is great .

233
00:25:38,390 --> 00:25:41,520
Right now I feel as if I could conquer the world .

234
00:25:41,640 --> 00:25:43,020
Starting with the castle .

235
00:25:43,140 --> 00:25:46,560
If I 'm not mistaken , someone there made quite an impression on you .

236
00:25:46,690 --> 00:25:50,150
An excellent idea ! Another little drink or two

237
00:25:52,650 --> 00:25:55,240
and that 's exactly where I 'd go .

238
00:25:55,360 --> 00:25:56,910
You 'd be wiser to go to sleep .

239
00:25:57,030 --> 00:25:59,910
Mysterious princesses are more easily conquered in dreams .

240
00:26:00,030 --> 00:26:02,040
Besides , we must be up early tomorrow .

241
00:26:02,160 --> 00:26:03,660
You 're right .

242
00:26:03,790 --> 00:26:07,920
- Er ... I 'll tell them to call us at five . - No , no , don 't bother , I 'll do it .

243
00:26:08,040 --> 00:26:10,460
I 'll take a little walk and then tell the innkeeper .

244
00:26:10,590 --> 00:26:12,960
- All right . Good night . - Good night .

245
00:26:14,130 --> 00:26:16,050
And watch out for bats !

246
00:26:16,970 --> 00:26:18,970
Watch out for your head !

247
00:26:28,480 --> 00:26:30,190
No !

248
00:26:30,980 --> 00:26:32,020
No , no .

249
00:26:32,150 --> 00:26:34,860
- Why do you always carry on like this ? - I don 't want to go .

250
00:26:34,990 --> 00:26:37,410
Who do you think should go ? Me , with all I have to do ?

251
00:26:37,530 --> 00:26:40,870
Oh , excuse me , sir , but isn 't it shameful that a big girl like her

252
00:26:40,990 --> 00:26:43,290
is afraid to go to milk the cow in the barn ?

253
00:26:43,410 --> 00:26:44,500
Your mother is right .

254
00:26:44,620 --> 00:26:47,620
She didn 't say that the barn is beside the old haunted cemetery .

255
00:26:47,750 --> 00:26:50,380
You mustn 't be afraid of the dead . They sleep soundly .

256
00:26:50,500 --> 00:26:52,380
Hear what the gentleman said ? I 'm coming !

257
00:26:52,500 --> 00:26:54,380
Hurry . I 'm busy . Get a move on !

258
00:26:54,510 --> 00:26:58,760
- I 've been waiting for a half-hour . - I 'll go tonight , but tomorrow I won 't .

259
00:27:34,420 --> 00:27:35,920
Ohh !

260
00:27:55,110 --> 00:27:56,480
Ohh !

261
00:28:06,290 --> 00:28:08,040
Hello , Irina .

262
00:28:54,380 --> 00:28:57,090
Rise , Javutich !

263
00:28:57,210 --> 00:28:59,050
Javutich !

264
00:28:59,170 --> 00:29:01,220
Rise !

265
00:29:01,340 --> 00:29:02,970
Javutich !

266
00:29:35,210 --> 00:29:37,040
Be still , Irina . Be still .

267
00:29:37,170 --> 00:29:39,250
Are you frightened , too ?

268
00:29:42,260 --> 00:29:44,630
Oh , it 's a storm .

269
00:30:01,650 --> 00:30:03,940
Be good , Irina .

270
00:35:03,120 --> 00:35:04,870
No !

271
00:35:10,880 --> 00:35:12,540
Father !

272
00:35:16,050 --> 00:35:18,130
- No ! No ! - Father !

273
00:35:18,260 --> 00:35:21,550
Look at me , Father . It 's Katia . Look at me !

274
00:35:21,680 --> 00:35:23,760
- We must find a doctor . - But where ?

275
00:35:23,890 --> 00:35:25,350
At the inn .

276
00:35:25,470 --> 00:35:27,810
I met two doctors today in front of the chapel .

277
00:35:27,940 --> 00:35:29,770
They said they were staying at Mirgorod .

278
00:35:29,900 --> 00:35:32,190
Hurry , Ivan ! Go down and wake up the groom .

279
00:35:32,310 --> 00:35:34,480
Here I am , Master . I heard someone scream .

280
00:35:34,610 --> 00:35:37,070
Go to the inn and get one of the doctors . At once !

281
00:35:37,190 --> 00:35:38,240
Yes , Master .

282
00:36:19,860 --> 00:36:22,280
- Dr Kruvajan ! - Yes ?

283
00:36:23,070 --> 00:36:25,950
Princess Vajda has sent me . Her father is very ill .

284
00:36:26,080 --> 00:36:28,700
She begs you to come to the castle .

285
00:36:28,830 --> 00:36:31,290
I 'll come , but first I must tell them at the inn .

286
00:36:31,420 --> 00:36:33,830
You won 't need to . I 've already done so .

287
00:36:33,960 --> 00:36:36,630
They told me there where I could find you .

288
00:36:37,380 --> 00:36:39,460
Ah . Very well , then .

289
00:39:24,960 --> 00:39:26,670
Hey !

290
00:42:09,920 --> 00:42:13,920
Kruvajan !

291
00:42:14,050 --> 00:42:16,050
I 've been waiting for you .

292
00:42:20,970 --> 00:42:23,270
I need you again .

293
00:42:23,390 --> 00:42:25,390
Look into my eyes .

294
00:42:26,650 --> 00:42:28,650
Look into my eyes !

295
00:42:29,360 --> 00:42:31,020
Come closer !

296
00:42:31,150 --> 00:42:35,820
Just a few drops of your blood brought me to life again .

297
00:42:35,950 --> 00:42:41,080
All of your blood will give me the strength to accomplish my vengeance .

298
00:42:41,200 --> 00:42:43,910
Come ! Kiss me !

299
00:42:44,040 --> 00:42:46,580
My lips will transform you .

300
00:42:54,590 --> 00:42:59,590
You will be dead to men , but you will be alive in death .

301
00:43:52,310 --> 00:43:54,900
What 's keeping Boris ? He 's been gone so long .

302
00:43:55,030 --> 00:43:56,900
He 'll be back any moment now .

303
00:44:02,410 --> 00:44:04,410
The griffin , the man in the painting ...

304
00:44:04,530 --> 00:44:06,950
- What 's he saying ? - He 's delirious .

305
00:44:07,080 --> 00:44:11,330
No , no , only the crucifix can save us

306
00:44:12,880 --> 00:44:16,170
on this day of the damned .

307
00:44:25,350 --> 00:44:27,180
Did you send for me ?

308
00:44:29,270 --> 00:44:32,310
I 'm so grateful to you for coming . My father is delirious .

309
00:44:32,440 --> 00:44:34,770
I 'll take a look at him . You may go now .

310
00:45:09,180 --> 00:45:10,850
What 's wrong with him , Doctor ?

311
00:45:10,980 --> 00:45:13,350
Nothing serious . He 's just had a slight shock .

312
00:45:13,480 --> 00:45:16,820
We were asleep when all of a sudden we heard a frightening scream .

313
00:45:16,940 --> 00:45:20,030
When we came in , he was trembling with his arm outstretched ,

314
00:45:20,150 --> 00:45:22,950
holding this cross to keep back some horrible apparition .

315
00:45:23,070 --> 00:45:24,860
Take it away !

316
00:45:24,990 --> 00:45:28,830
He mustn 't see it . It might provoke another attack .

317
00:45:29,620 --> 00:45:32,460
Our eternal sleep has been broken .

318
00:45:32,580 --> 00:45:34,500
You were able to do it .

319
00:45:34,620 --> 00:45:37,960
You tore me out of the earth that weighed heavily on me .

320
00:45:38,090 --> 00:45:40,630
This time you are not alone .

321
00:45:40,760 --> 00:45:42,920
I will bring you her body .

322
00:45:43,050 --> 00:45:45,140
She will be your victim .

323
00:45:45,260 --> 00:45:47,510
She was born for this fate .

324
00:45:47,640 --> 00:45:50,350
She is your living image .

325
00:45:50,470 --> 00:45:53,440
Destiny has its way , Asa .

326
00:45:54,230 --> 00:45:56,690
In her you will live again ,

327
00:45:56,810 --> 00:45:58,520
speak again

328
00:45:58,650 --> 00:46:00,900
and smile as she does .

329
00:46:01,030 --> 00:46:03,990
We 'll live once more , as we used to .

330
00:46:18,080 --> 00:46:21,050
Get some rest , Constantine . Father is sleeping quietly .

331
00:46:21,170 --> 00:46:24,010
- No , I 'm not tired . - Go , both of you . I will stay here .

332
00:46:25,470 --> 00:46:27,890
Oh , dear , those dogs keep howling so !

333
00:46:28,010 --> 00:46:30,220
Ivan , try to quiet them .

334
00:46:30,350 --> 00:46:31,770
Yes , my lady .

335
00:46:31,890 --> 00:46:33,770
You go . I 'll stay here .

336
00:46:33,890 --> 00:46:36,480
- But if ... - I 'll call you if necessary .

337
00:46:36,600 --> 00:46:37,650
All right , then .

338
00:46:44,610 --> 00:46:46,490
What 's the matter ?

339
00:46:46,610 --> 00:46:48,280
Shh ... quiet now !

340
00:47:30,490 --> 00:47:31,620
What is it ?

341
00:47:31,740 --> 00:47:34,870
I thought you 'd fallen asleep . Why don 't you go to bed now ?

342
00:47:34,990 --> 00:47:36,960
I 'll stay and watch over your father .

343
00:47:37,080 --> 00:47:39,620
But aren 't you leaving Mirgorod at dawn ?

344
00:47:39,750 --> 00:47:43,040
It doesn 't matter . I can stay the night here .

345
00:47:50,720 --> 00:47:53,390
He seems to be much calmer now , doesn 't he ?

346
00:47:53,510 --> 00:47:56,430
Yes . You 'll see he 'll have a restful night 's sleep .

347
00:47:56,560 --> 00:47:58,430
You needn 't worry any more .

348
00:47:58,560 --> 00:48:01,650
Go and get some rest yourself . You must need it .

349
00:48:01,770 --> 00:48:04,400
Doctor , I don 't know how to thank you .

350
00:48:04,520 --> 00:48:06,940
Please call me if there should be any change .

351
00:48:07,070 --> 00:48:08,990
I am sure there will be no need .

352
00:48:09,110 --> 00:48:11,240
Your room is across the corridor here .

353
00:48:11,360 --> 00:48:14,830
- Good night , and thank you again . - Good night .

354
00:49:12,720 --> 00:49:14,340
Katia !

355
00:49:16,140 --> 00:49:17,680
Katia !

356
00:49:18,680 --> 00:49:20,270
Katia !

357
00:49:20,980 --> 00:49:23,480
- Poor father ! - No !

358
00:49:24,350 --> 00:49:28,440
Dr Kruvajan !

359
00:49:28,570 --> 00:49:30,900
No , Katia ! Don 't go !

360
00:49:32,570 --> 00:49:35,110
Katia , don 't ... Don 't look , Katia !

361
00:49:39,330 --> 00:49:41,370
Professor Kruvajan !

362
00:49:42,830 --> 00:49:44,670
Professor Kruvajan !

363
00:49:45,580 --> 00:49:47,290
It 's Andre .

364
00:49:48,130 --> 00:49:50,380
Your friend has already left the inn .

365
00:49:50,510 --> 00:49:53,420
- Left ? - Last night . He was called to the castle .

366
00:49:53,550 --> 00:49:56,930
It seems that Prince Vajda was suddenly taken seriously ill .

367
00:49:57,050 --> 00:49:58,810
He hasn 't come back yet .

368
00:49:58,930 --> 00:50:02,520
- I wonder why he didn 't take me . - Maybe he didn 't want to disturb you .

369
00:50:02,640 --> 00:50:06,940
My daughter saw him get in the coach that came from the castle to pick him up .

370
00:50:07,060 --> 00:50:09,900
- Could I have a horse ? - Right away . Come with me .

371
00:50:17,120 --> 00:50:20,280
Be careful ! If you upset the basket , I 'll fix you !

372
00:50:23,290 --> 00:50:25,080
Say ! Excuse me .

373
00:50:25,210 --> 00:50:27,330
Is this the shortest road to the Vajda castle ?

374
00:50:27,460 --> 00:50:30,710
- Yes , sir , take the one going uphill . - Thank you .

375
00:50:30,840 --> 00:50:33,300
The current 's stronger down here .

376
00:50:33,420 --> 00:50:35,760
Oh , please ! I told you not to play around here !

377
00:50:35,880 --> 00:50:38,850
- The shirt 's fallen in the water ! - There it is !

378
00:50:38,970 --> 00:50:41,430
A shirt ! Oh , how am I going to catch it ?

379
00:50:42,640 --> 00:50:44,730
Watch out or you 'll fall in the water , too !

380
00:50:44,850 --> 00:50:48,520
There it is ! It 's getting closer . There it is !

381
00:50:48,650 --> 00:50:50,270
Who is it ?

382
00:50:52,360 --> 00:50:53,400
Ohh !

383
00:51:19,970 --> 00:51:21,800
Dr Kruvajan !

384
00:51:40,660 --> 00:51:42,830
Who are you ? What do you want ?

385
00:51:43,790 --> 00:51:45,700
I am Dr Gorobec .

386
00:51:45,830 --> 00:51:48,620
I heard that Dr Kruvajan was called to the castle last night .

387
00:51:48,750 --> 00:51:51,040
Yes , that is correct .

388
00:51:51,170 --> 00:51:54,590
We called him to attend my father , who had a sudden attack of shock .

389
00:51:54,710 --> 00:51:58,170
We left the doctor alone with him , but he went away .

390
00:51:58,300 --> 00:52:02,430
If he hadn 't left my father alone like this , he might still be alive .

391
00:52:03,390 --> 00:52:07,600
I must say , I don 't understand your colleague 's strange behaviour in this case .

392
00:52:08,520 --> 00:52:10,060
You 're right .

393
00:52:10,190 --> 00:52:11,730
I don 't know how to explain it ,

394
00:52:11,850 --> 00:52:14,650
but I assure you I am much more surprised than you are .

395
00:52:14,770 --> 00:52:17,190
I know Professor Kruvajan very well .

396
00:52:18,860 --> 00:52:20,450
I don 't understand .

397
00:52:20,570 --> 00:52:23,450
Something serious must have happened , I am sure of it .

398
00:52:24,240 --> 00:52:27,700
It 's very strange . When I left the inn , he still hadn 't returned .

399
00:52:27,830 --> 00:52:29,660
He 's not there ?

400
00:52:31,080 --> 00:52:32,830
Please , come up .

401
00:52:34,960 --> 00:52:38,260
Merciful heaven , it 's Boris , the groom from the castle .

402
00:52:38,380 --> 00:52:40,050
I want to see ! Let me by !

403
00:52:40,170 --> 00:52:41,880
That 's who it is . Poor Boris !

404
00:52:42,010 --> 00:52:44,220
He looks terrible . How did he end up here ?

405
00:52:44,350 --> 00:52:46,100
The river . Can 't you see he 's dead ?

406
00:53:02,410 --> 00:53:04,450
- Ah ... - Katia !

407
00:53:04,570 --> 00:53:06,120
- We must take her away . - Yes .

408
00:53:06,240 --> 00:53:08,540
- Where is her room ? - This way .

409
00:53:23,680 --> 00:53:25,260
Quickly , some water .

410
00:54:20,650 --> 00:54:22,530
The features of his face are changed .

411
00:54:22,650 --> 00:54:25,030
They are not human . It 's like the face of Satan .

412
00:54:25,150 --> 00:54:26,410
It made me sick to see it .

413
00:54:26,530 --> 00:54:29,200
It 's as if the Demon had devoured him from the inside .

414
00:54:29,330 --> 00:54:30,790
Shh . Don 't talk so loud .

415
00:54:30,910 --> 00:54:34,750
Maybe it 's better not to tell them . They 're stricken by their father 's death .

416
00:54:34,870 --> 00:54:37,040
Ivan ! What 's this all about ?

417
00:54:37,170 --> 00:54:40,420
They 've found Boris 's body , my lord , down by the stream .

418
00:54:40,540 --> 00:54:41,670
Boris 's body ?

419
00:54:41,800 --> 00:54:44,220
Yes , Your Excellency . You should see how he looks .

420
00:54:44,340 --> 00:54:46,720
His eyes are popping out of their sockets , his teeth are bared ,

421
00:54:46,840 --> 00:54:49,010
and his hands are clenched .

422
00:54:49,140 --> 00:54:50,510
Where is he now ?

423
00:54:51,640 --> 00:54:54,980
We carried him into the sacristy . The parish priest is with him .

424
00:54:56,020 --> 00:54:58,480
- You there ! - Me ?

425
00:54:58,600 --> 00:55:00,480
Yes . Come here .

426
00:55:02,480 --> 00:55:06,860
Your mother says you saw the carriage that came to fetch Dr Kruvajan .

427
00:55:06,990 --> 00:55:08,410
Yes , my lord .

428
00:55:08,530 --> 00:55:10,490
I saw it as I was coming back from the barn .

429
00:55:10,620 --> 00:55:12,620
I heard a noise , so I hid in the bushes .

430
00:55:12,740 --> 00:55:15,120
But it wasn 't Boris who was driving the coach .

431
00:55:15,250 --> 00:55:17,370
I know Boris 's face very well .

432
00:55:17,500 --> 00:55:20,330
It was a stranger . At least , I 've never seen him before .

433
00:55:20,460 --> 00:55:23,050
- Are you sure ? - Oh , yes , my lord .

434
00:55:23,960 --> 00:55:26,590
I 'm going to the village to see Boris 's body .

435
00:55:26,720 --> 00:55:30,430
And you come with me , but remember , you must tell me everything you know .

436
00:55:30,550 --> 00:55:33,760
Do you understand that ? It 's very important .

437
00:55:33,890 --> 00:55:36,350
Certainly , sir . I 'll tell you everything .

438
00:55:37,100 --> 00:55:38,890
Go on . So long , now .

439
00:55:39,020 --> 00:55:40,980
Go on to your houses . Go on .

440
00:55:41,690 --> 00:55:43,400
That 's the man !

441
00:55:43,940 --> 00:55:46,110
Yes ! That 's who it is !

442
00:55:46,240 --> 00:55:49,070
The man who came last night to get Dr Kruvajan .

443
00:55:49,200 --> 00:55:52,870
I swear it , my lord . That 's the man . I 'm certain .

444
00:55:52,990 --> 00:55:55,660
I could see him clearly . The moon was shining on his face .

445
00:55:55,790 --> 00:55:56,830
Whose face ?

446
00:55:56,950 --> 00:55:58,620
Enough of this child 's fantasies

447
00:55:58,750 --> 00:56:02,040
about a portrait of someone who 's been lying dead for centuries ,

448
00:56:02,170 --> 00:56:04,340
or else we 'll all go mad .

449
00:56:04,460 --> 00:56:06,130
Calm yourself , Princess .

450
00:56:06,880 --> 00:56:09,130
I must leave you now , but I 'll be back .

451
00:56:09,260 --> 00:56:10,760
And try to be courageous .

452
00:56:10,890 --> 00:56:13,970
We 'd be glad to have you stay here with us tonight , Doctor .

453
00:56:15,180 --> 00:56:16,470
Yes .

454
00:56:17,220 --> 00:56:19,600
Please do , we 'll feel so much safer .

455
00:56:34,120 --> 00:56:35,950
It 's incredible .

456
00:56:36,080 --> 00:56:38,910
He died in the same horrible way as the Prince .

457
00:56:39,660 --> 00:56:42,500
The wounds on his neck look like the work of a wild beast ,

458
00:56:42,630 --> 00:56:45,500
but one who punctures the flesh without tearing it .

459
00:56:47,210 --> 00:56:50,760
As a doctor I have complete faith in science , but ...

460
00:56:53,260 --> 00:56:56,510
And this strange behaviour of Professor Kruvajan .

461
00:56:56,640 --> 00:57:00,310
It doesn 't seem possible that a man such as he could abandon a patient

462
00:57:00,430 --> 00:57:02,900
and disappear without saying anything .

463
00:57:04,810 --> 00:57:08,360
On my way here I passed by the inn , but no one had seen him ,

464
00:57:08,480 --> 00:57:11,070
and the innkeeper 's daughter insisted today

465
00:57:11,200 --> 00:57:14,490
that the man in the portrait at the castle is the same as the driver

466
00:57:14,620 --> 00:57:17,410
who came last night to fetch Professor Kruvajan .

467
00:57:17,540 --> 00:57:19,500
It makes my head spin . I don 't understand .

468
00:57:19,620 --> 00:57:21,790
The man in the portrait , did you say ?

469
00:57:21,910 --> 00:57:24,630
Yes , the portrait hanging near the fireplace .

470
00:57:24,750 --> 00:57:27,090
An old 17th-century painting .

471
00:57:27,210 --> 00:57:31,010
A painting of a man in black with a silver griffin embroidered on his chest ?

472
00:57:31,130 --> 00:57:32,880
Yes . Why ?

473
00:57:37,890 --> 00:57:39,810
Nothing . Nothing .

474
00:57:45,770 --> 00:57:47,230
Oh , Father .

475
00:57:47,360 --> 00:57:51,030
Prince Constantine would like you to prepare the funeral for tomorrow .

476
00:57:51,150 --> 00:57:54,030
Yes , very well . Everything will be ready for tomorrow .

477
00:58:28,440 --> 00:58:30,020
Go !

478
01:00:14,800 --> 01:00:16,550
Help !

479
01:00:16,670 --> 01:00:18,260
Help me !

480
01:00:19,510 --> 01:00:21,220
What is it ? Katia ?

481
01:00:21,340 --> 01:00:24,140
- What is it , Princess ? - There 's someone hiding in my room .

482
01:00:24,260 --> 01:00:25,930
- Where ? - Behind the curtain .

483
01:00:26,060 --> 01:00:28,680
Come ! Ivan , stand guard in the salon .

484
01:00:31,690 --> 01:00:33,560
Over there , behind the curtain .

485
01:00:41,530 --> 01:00:44,070
There 's nobody there . You must have imagined it .

486
01:00:44,200 --> 01:00:47,870
No ! I saw it through the mirror . I saw a hand .

487
01:00:49,120 --> 01:00:54,340
You don 't believe me , but I tell you , Constantine , I saw it , I saw it ...

488
01:00:54,460 --> 01:00:57,000
- I 'll get her a sedative . - Katia , don 't cry .

489
01:01:13,520 --> 01:01:16,320
Professor Kruvajan , it 's you ! You frightened me .

490
01:01:16,440 --> 01:01:18,440
Where have you been ? What happened ?

491
01:01:19,570 --> 01:01:21,740
I 've been searching for you all day .

492
01:01:23,700 --> 01:01:24,820
Your hair !

493
01:01:25,950 --> 01:01:29,450
Go away , Andre . Far away from here .

494
01:01:29,580 --> 01:01:32,250
Don 't get involved in things that don 't concern you .

495
01:01:32,370 --> 01:01:37,090
Since you didn 't come to the inn , I brought your luggage here for you .

496
01:01:37,210 --> 01:01:41,050
Look , I was just trying to decipher this inscription .

497
01:01:46,140 --> 01:01:48,010
Professor !

498
01:02:12,040 --> 01:02:13,290
Krug ! Brug !

499
01:02:16,920 --> 01:02:20,340
- They 're bleeding to death . - Yes , and I think I know who ...

500
01:02:21,550 --> 01:02:23,420
Come now . Quickly !

501
01:02:23,550 --> 01:02:26,890
Carry everything into the salon where the coffin will be set up .

502
01:02:27,890 --> 01:02:30,010
Take this . Easy , there .

503
01:02:31,310 --> 01:02:33,270
And he fled from you in terror ?

504
01:02:33,390 --> 01:02:35,230
Yes , the moment I showed him the icon

505
01:02:35,350 --> 01:02:37,770
he disappeared without any explanation .

506
01:02:38,770 --> 01:02:41,400
It 's very difficult to find the right translation

507
01:02:41,530 --> 01:02:44,320
for these old Cyrillic inscriptions .

508
01:02:44,450 --> 01:02:47,320
The important thing is to get the key word .

509
01:02:48,200 --> 01:02:52,040
If I take it with me , I 'll compare it with some texts I have in the library .

510
01:02:52,160 --> 01:02:54,410
- I 'd be so grateful to you . - Father .

511
01:02:54,540 --> 01:02:58,500
As you know , my sister 's been suffering terribly from these shocking events .

512
01:02:58,630 --> 01:03:01,460
I 'd appreciate it if you could urge her to leave the castle .

513
01:03:01,590 --> 01:03:04,340
I tried to convince her , but it was useless .

514
01:03:04,470 --> 01:03:06,930
She said it would be disrespectful .

515
01:03:52,890 --> 01:03:54,220
Princess Katia .

516
01:03:57,560 --> 01:03:59,730
I hope I 'm not intruding .

517
01:03:59,850 --> 01:04:03,980
No , I just feel so desperate and alone .

518
01:04:04,110 --> 01:04:06,900
I understand , but you mustn 't despair .

519
01:04:07,030 --> 01:04:10,740
You must always have faith in yourself , in life .

520
01:04:11,660 --> 01:04:13,160
In life ?

521
01:04:13,280 --> 01:04:15,990
What is my life ? Sadness and grief .

522
01:04:16,120 --> 01:04:21,250
Something that destroys itself day by day , and no one can rebuild it .

523
01:04:22,750 --> 01:04:25,670
Here is the very image of my life .

524
01:04:25,800 --> 01:04:27,840
Look at it .

525
01:04:27,970 --> 01:04:31,220
It 's being consumed hour by hour like this garden .

526
01:04:32,800 --> 01:04:35,430
Abandoned to a purposeless existence .

527
01:04:37,520 --> 01:04:40,810
If the hand of man abandons this castle ,

528
01:04:40,940 --> 01:04:43,060
or even this Earth ,

529
01:04:43,190 --> 01:04:47,070
there is no reason why you should do likewise with your life and your youth .

530
01:04:48,780 --> 01:04:53,120
Go far away from here and you will be happy again , Katia .

531
01:04:54,070 --> 01:04:56,160
Forgive me if I call you by name .

532
01:04:56,950 --> 01:04:59,960
And remember that I 'll always be ready to help you .

533
01:05:01,040 --> 01:05:03,000
You 're very kind , Andre ,

534
01:05:03,130 --> 01:05:05,840
but today everything seems so hopeless .

535
01:05:05,960 --> 01:05:09,670
I feel a sense of terror , a presentiment of death ,

536
01:05:10,920 --> 01:05:13,800
of being destroyed by something that 's inside me .

537
01:05:15,180 --> 01:05:18,220
How I wish I had your faith , your strength .

538
01:05:18,350 --> 01:05:20,890
You mustn 't give in to despair .

539
01:05:21,020 --> 01:05:23,900
I know it 's hard for you ,

540
01:05:24,020 --> 01:05:27,690
but even here in this garden the sun will reach into the darkest corners

541
01:05:27,820 --> 01:05:30,280
and chase away the shadows of the night .

542
01:05:31,700 --> 01:05:34,870
Andre , help me .

543
01:05:34,990 --> 01:05:37,780
I beg you to help me .

544
01:06:08,610 --> 01:06:09,650
Oh !

545
01:06:20,660 --> 01:06:22,660
Thank you .

546
01:06:22,790 --> 01:06:25,790
Without you I wouldn 't have had the courage to go on .

547
01:06:26,630 --> 01:06:31,130
In moments like this it 's difficult to ... find the right words , but ...

548
01:06:32,170 --> 01:06:35,090
when this is all over , Katia ...

549
01:06:36,550 --> 01:06:38,430
Thank you , Andre .

550
01:06:39,180 --> 01:06:40,680
Thank you .

551
01:06:42,470 --> 01:06:45,770
It was the only way I could think of to put out the fire , my lord .

552
01:06:45,890 --> 01:06:47,480
Strange .

553
01:06:47,600 --> 01:06:49,940
I wonder what can be hidden behind here .

554
01:06:50,070 --> 01:06:51,320
Doctor !

555
01:06:51,440 --> 01:06:54,360
When Ivan was putting out a fire that had started in a hanging

556
01:06:54,490 --> 01:06:56,280
he ripped through this canvas .

557
01:06:56,410 --> 01:06:58,530
- Look . - Be careful .

558
01:07:06,040 --> 01:07:08,330
It 's pitch-black inside here .

559
01:07:20,300 --> 01:07:22,140
A secret passageway .

560
01:07:23,810 --> 01:07:25,770
Then my father was not delirious .

561
01:07:26,560 --> 01:07:31,610
And his last words were " the silver griffin " and " the man in the portrait " .

562
01:07:31,730 --> 01:07:34,690
This is where I found the dogs with their throats slashed ,

563
01:07:34,820 --> 01:07:36,700
where Kruvajan disappeared .

564
01:07:36,820 --> 01:07:38,530
Let 's go in .

565
01:07:41,990 --> 01:07:43,490
You stay here , Ivan .

566
01:07:43,620 --> 01:07:46,000
Make sure the door doesn 't close . Don 't move .

567
01:07:46,120 --> 01:07:47,660
No , my lord .

568
01:07:58,840 --> 01:08:01,680
It 's the same girl as the portrait in the salon .

569
01:08:02,720 --> 01:08:04,770
The witch in the crypt .

570
01:08:04,890 --> 01:08:06,850
How did you know about her ?

571
01:08:06,980 --> 01:08:11,060
I saw her when Dr Kruvajan and I visited the abandoned chapel .

572
01:08:12,480 --> 01:08:14,020
Wait a minute .

573
01:09:12,790 --> 01:09:16,130
Two days ago , this tomb was intact , and the witch ...

574
01:09:16,250 --> 01:09:18,340
She looks as if she had just died .

575
01:09:18,920 --> 01:09:19,970
Look !

576
01:09:21,090 --> 01:09:22,510
She 's breathing .

577
01:09:22,630 --> 01:09:25,140
We 're in the presence of some unnatural mystery .

578
01:09:25,260 --> 01:09:26,560
I must talk to the priest .

579
01:09:26,680 --> 01:09:29,850
You return to the castle . Don 't leave Katia alone for a moment .

580
01:09:29,980 --> 01:09:32,730
Go out that way , you 'll get to the stables quicker .

581
01:09:54,790 --> 01:09:56,290
Ivan !

582
01:09:56,880 --> 01:09:58,170
Ivan !

583
01:10:05,800 --> 01:10:08,050
From what you tell me , there can be no more doubt .

584
01:10:08,180 --> 01:10:10,720
We are faced by the unleashed powers of the Demon .

585
01:10:10,850 --> 01:10:14,020
The ancient words on the icon explain exactly what must be done .

586
01:10:14,140 --> 01:10:17,860
We must find the grave of Javutich ... before sunset .

587
01:11:09,950 --> 01:11:11,660
Father !

588
01:11:11,790 --> 01:11:14,660
- Yes ? - Look , the mask of Satan .

589
01:11:14,790 --> 01:11:17,250
Like the one I saw over the witch 's face .

590
01:11:17,370 --> 01:11:19,630
It 's just as I had feared .

591
01:11:19,750 --> 01:11:21,880
We 'll find him buried here .

592
01:11:24,130 --> 01:11:26,260
Look ! A freshly dug grave .

593
01:11:28,510 --> 01:11:30,180
Open the coffin .

594
01:11:50,950 --> 01:11:52,580
It 's Dr Kruvajan .

595
01:11:52,700 --> 01:11:56,540
But ... last night ... he was still alive .

596
01:11:58,040 --> 01:11:59,540
I saw him .

597
01:11:59,670 --> 01:12:02,250
No , he was already dead .

598
01:12:02,380 --> 01:12:04,670
But it 's impossible , Father .

599
01:12:04,800 --> 01:12:07,130
He moved , even spoke to me .

600
01:12:07,260 --> 01:12:09,430
Then he ran away .

601
01:12:09,550 --> 01:12:14,060
Sometimes Satan , with his capacity of doing evil ,

602
01:12:14,180 --> 01:12:16,470
even plays tricks with the dead .

603
01:12:25,900 --> 01:12:28,110
You see ? This is the proof .

604
01:12:32,070 --> 01:12:35,450
Now we must find a way for his poor soul to rest in peace .

605
01:12:37,000 --> 01:12:38,790
Yes , but how ?

606
01:12:40,710 --> 01:12:45,710
The inscription on the icon indicates the only way .

607
01:12:52,970 --> 01:12:55,140
The spell is broken .

608
01:12:56,220 --> 01:12:58,140
Poor Kruvajan .

609
01:13:00,730 --> 01:13:02,480
We must take action .

610
01:13:02,600 --> 01:13:05,150
And quickly , for now it is all clear .

611
01:13:05,270 --> 01:13:09,900
The witch had transformed your friend into the slave of the Devil .

612
01:13:10,030 --> 01:13:13,780
Dead during the day , but alive by night ,

613
01:13:13,910 --> 01:13:17,660
so he could carry out Satan 's nefarious orders .

614
01:13:17,790 --> 01:13:20,080
- Then the Prince , too ? - Yes .

615
01:13:20,210 --> 01:13:22,250
But now we will have to make haste ,

616
01:13:22,370 --> 01:13:25,420
for the witch may regain her life completely .

617
01:13:25,540 --> 01:13:26,800
How could she ?

618
01:13:26,920 --> 01:13:29,510
By possessing and entering the body of a young woman .

619
01:13:29,630 --> 01:13:31,930
- Katia ! - Yes , Katia .

620
01:13:32,050 --> 01:13:34,800
Hurry back to the castle . It 's late .

621
01:13:34,930 --> 01:13:38,470
Before the sun goes down , go to the crypt and pierce the left eye of the witch .

622
01:13:38,600 --> 01:13:39,640
Go now .

623
01:13:39,770 --> 01:13:43,100
I will do the same to the body of Boris , which is still in the sacristy .

624
01:13:43,230 --> 01:13:44,900
And then I 'll join you .

625
01:13:49,480 --> 01:13:51,150
Constantine ?

626
01:13:51,280 --> 01:13:52,950
Ivan ?

627
01:14:09,550 --> 01:14:11,380
Ivan ?

628
01:14:11,510 --> 01:14:13,340
Constantine ?

629
01:14:21,430 --> 01:14:23,600
Where is everyone ?

630
01:14:27,310 --> 01:14:28,940
Where have you gone ?

631
01:14:34,280 --> 01:14:37,660
Help !

632
01:14:47,000 --> 01:14:48,540
Help !

633
01:14:48,670 --> 01:14:50,500
Where are you ?

634
01:14:50,630 --> 01:14:52,010
Help !

635
01:14:52,960 --> 01:14:54,510
Constantine !

636
01:14:54,630 --> 01:14:56,260
Andre !

637
01:15:03,180 --> 01:15:04,930
Help me , Father !

638
01:15:05,690 --> 01:15:07,310
Please help me .

639
01:15:07,900 --> 01:15:10,770
Don 't leave me alone with all these horrors .

640
01:15:36,300 --> 01:15:37,720
Father !

641
01:15:38,640 --> 01:15:40,430
Father ? Father !

642
01:15:41,850 --> 01:15:43,850
I am no longer your father .

643
01:15:43,970 --> 01:15:45,770
My blood is no longer your blood .

644
01:15:45,890 --> 01:15:48,850
The spirits of evil have rent that tie between us forever ,

645
01:15:48,980 --> 01:15:51,650
and an accursed poison flows in your veins .

646
01:15:51,770 --> 01:15:53,730
Ohh !

647
01:15:58,950 --> 01:16:00,370
No !

648
01:16:58,880 --> 01:17:00,130
Constantine !

649
01:17:00,260 --> 01:17:01,430
Ivan !

650
01:17:01,550 --> 01:17:03,220
Open up !

651
01:17:07,310 --> 01:17:10,640
At last your vengeance is at hand , Asa .

652
01:17:10,770 --> 01:17:13,480
Now you will be free forever .

653
01:17:21,280 --> 01:17:22,740
Katia !

654
01:17:24,410 --> 01:17:25,870
Constantine !

655
01:17:25,990 --> 01:17:27,790
Where are you ?

656
01:17:42,010 --> 01:17:44,760
Katia ! Constantine !

657
01:18:01,990 --> 01:18:03,570
Katia !

658
01:19:17,650 --> 01:19:20,310
You did not know that you were born for this moment .

659
01:19:20,440 --> 01:19:24,190
You didn 't know that your life had been consecrated to me by Satan ,

660
01:19:24,320 --> 01:19:26,860
but you sensed it , didn 't you ?

661
01:19:28,160 --> 01:19:30,070
You sensed it , didn 't you ?

662
01:19:30,200 --> 01:19:33,080
That 's why my portrait was a constant temptation to you ,

663
01:19:33,200 --> 01:19:34,410
why it frightened you .

664
01:19:34,540 --> 01:19:36,580
You felt your life and your body were mine .

665
01:19:36,710 --> 01:19:40,790
You felt like me because you were destined to become me ,

666
01:19:40,920 --> 01:19:43,710
a useless body without life .

667
01:19:45,010 --> 01:19:47,840
The love that young man had for you could have saved you .

668
01:19:47,970 --> 01:19:50,720
You might have been happy together , but I was stronger

669
01:19:50,850 --> 01:19:56,980
and now you shall enjoy a beautiful life of evil and hate in me .

670
01:20:48,740 --> 01:20:50,740
No !

671
01:21:03,500 --> 01:21:05,170
Constantine !

672
01:21:05,290 --> 01:21:07,300
Don 't worry about me .

673
01:21:07,420 --> 01:21:09,260
Save Katia .

674
01:21:09,380 --> 01:21:11,180
Don 't lose time .

675
01:21:11,300 --> 01:21:14,050
Save Katia ... from the witch .

676
01:21:36,280 --> 01:21:38,160
Katia !

677
01:21:38,290 --> 01:21:41,250
Katia , thank heaven ... that I 've arrived in time .

678
01:21:41,370 --> 01:21:44,880
Yes , she wanted to kill me .

679
01:21:45,000 --> 01:21:48,000
Quick , Andre , do something before it 's too late .

680
01:21:48,130 --> 01:21:49,760
I couldn 't do it . Quickly .

681
01:21:49,880 --> 01:21:52,170
Yes , yes , you 're right .

682
01:21:52,300 --> 01:21:54,390
We must destroy her forever ,

683
01:21:54,510 --> 01:21:56,800
and I know how it can be done .

684
01:22:02,770 --> 01:22:04,230
Don 't look , Katia .

685
01:22:04,350 --> 01:22:06,440
It 's horrible , but I must do it .

686
01:22:31,010 --> 01:22:32,470
But this is your cross .

687
01:22:33,670 --> 01:22:36,680
Katia ! How is it possible ?

688
01:22:46,690 --> 01:22:48,560
I understand .

689
01:22:50,780 --> 01:22:51,780
Come .

690
01:22:51,900 --> 01:22:53,280
No !

691
01:22:55,240 --> 01:22:57,530
No , I am not your love .

692
01:22:57,660 --> 01:22:59,990
There she lies , dead .

693
01:23:00,120 --> 01:23:02,620
Forever . Forever .

694
01:23:02,750 --> 01:23:04,540
My vengeance is complete .

695
01:23:04,660 --> 01:23:07,630
All of her family is destroyed . All !

696
01:23:08,540 --> 01:23:11,840
Look , Andre . Look into my eyes .

697
01:23:11,960 --> 01:23:16,300
Yes , look at me the way Kruvajan did that night

698
01:23:16,430 --> 01:23:19,390
and , like him , lose yourself deep in my eyes .

699
01:23:19,510 --> 01:23:23,470
Don 't you feel the joy and the beauty of hating ?

700
01:23:23,600 --> 01:23:25,180
Look !

701
01:23:29,520 --> 01:23:31,570
She ... She is the witch .

702
01:23:31,690 --> 01:23:34,360
Don 't be deceived by her face . Look at her body .

703
01:23:34,490 --> 01:23:37,360
She is transforming herself into Katia

704
01:23:37,490 --> 01:23:38,950
by draining her life 's blood .

705
01:23:39,070 --> 01:23:40,570
Take her !

706
01:24:22,990 --> 01:24:24,490
Two centuries ago ,

707
01:24:24,620 --> 01:24:28,330
a storm prevented the flames from destroying her wicked soul ,

708
01:24:28,460 --> 01:24:34,960
but today her innocent victims have broken the spell of Satan .

709
01:24:43,890 --> 01:24:45,260
Why ?

710
01:24:45,390 --> 01:24:48,520
Why was Katia taken away from me , Father ?

711
01:24:51,600 --> 01:24:54,650
And she is dying with Katia 's beauty .

712
01:24:57,690 --> 01:24:59,150
Katia ...

713
01:25:00,320 --> 01:25:02,700
My life is finished too now .

714
01:25:05,490 --> 01:25:07,450
How can I ever forget her ?

715
01:25:08,160 --> 01:25:10,370
How can I resign myself ?

716
01:25:11,250 --> 01:25:13,380
I will never find peace .

717
01:25:16,710 --> 01:25:19,630
Look , her young body ... destroyed .

718
01:25:45,200 --> 01:25:46,780
Father !

719
01:26:06,640 --> 01:26:09,600
Katia .

